- Compared the local draft’s `implement_with_tdd`, `validate_contract_docs`, `Files to Change`, `TDD Test List`, and `Acceptance Criteria` sections against the current hardcoded `STRICT_FILES` list in `tests/docs/test_banned_stale_references.py`.
- Compared the local draft’s data-placement wording against the current authority text in `docs/standards/DATA_PLACEMENT.md`.
- Verified the current `docs/plans/README.md` already contains a `#2460` row and checked whether the local draft treats that row as verification-only rather than new additive work.
- Verified live issue `#2460` metadata/labels and checked the draft’s Resource Intelligence Summary against the mandatory source-union rules in `docs/plans/README.md`.
- Reviewed the local draft’s review-state/status language for lingering stale approval-state narrative.
